@startuml
actor User
participant "Unified shell" as Web
participant "Workspace API" as API
participant "Authorisation" as Authz
participant "Document access" as DocAccess
database PostgreSQL as DB

User -> Web: Search query
Web -> API: GET /workspace/search
API -> Authz: require workspace.search
Authz -> DB: active role + scope
DB --> Authz: permitted
API -> DB: owner-filtered conversations/outputs
API -> DB: assigned review tasks
API -> DB: candidate document versions
loop each document candidate
  API -> DocAccess: require_version(version_id)
  DocAccess -> DB: tenant, scope, visibility, ownership
  DB --> DocAccess: allow/deny
end
API --> Web: authorised typed results only
Web --> User: Search cards
@enduml
